tus":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m066-0324","start":324,"end":326,"surface":"蜀侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、氏族、群體或未核指代；不補造個人或按熟知世系自動合併。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p072","text":"十七年春，與秦戰丹陽，秦大敗我軍，斬甲士八萬，虜我大將軍屈匄、裨將軍逢侯丑等七十餘人，遂取漢中之郡。楚懷王大怒，乃悉國兵復襲秦，戰於藍田，大敗楚軍。韓、魏聞楚之困，乃南襲楚，至於鄧。楚聞，乃引兵歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m072-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"屈匄","kind":"person","person_id":"c38_dzq_0o4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m072-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"逢侯丑","kind":"person","person_id":"eqw_jou_32v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m072-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"楚懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p022","text":"張儀至秦，詳失綏墮車，不朝三月。楚王聞之，曰：「儀以寡人絕齊未甚邪？」乃使勇士至宋，借宋之符，北罵齊王。齊王大怒，折節而下秦。秦齊之交合，張儀乃朝，謂楚使者曰：「臣有奉邑六里，願以獻大王左右。」楚使者曰：「臣受令於王，以商於之地六百里，不聞六里。」還報楚王，楚王大怒，發兵而攻秦。陳軫曰：「軫可發口言乎？攻之不如割地反以賂秦，與之并兵而攻齊，是我出地於秦，取償於齊也，王國尚可存。」楚王不聽，卒發兵而使將軍屈丐擊秦。秦齊共攻楚，斬首八萬，殺屈丐，遂取丹陽、漢中之地。楚又復益發兵而襲秦，至藍田，大戰，楚大敗，於是楚割兩城以與秦平。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"uq6_74z_vtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"儀","kind":"person","person_id":"uq6_74z_vtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"勇士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、未定身分或擬議婚姻，不補姓名、實受關係或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"ona_sbo_027","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"ona_sbo_027","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"uq6_74z_vtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0075","start":75,"end":78,"surface":"楚使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、未定身分或擬議婚姻，不補姓名、實受關係或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0097","start":97,"end":100,"surface":"楚使者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、未定身分或擬議婚姻，不補姓名、實受關係或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0140","start":140,"end":142,"surface":"陳軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"軫","kind":"person","person_id":"bvi_h86_vk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"屈丐","kind":"person","person_id":"c38_dzq_0o4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m022-0220","start":220,"end":222,"surface":"屈丐","kind":"person","person_id":"c38_dzq_0o4","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p004","text":"屈平既絀，其後秦欲伐齊。齊與楚從親，惠王患之。乃令張儀詳去秦，厚幣委質事楚，曰：「秦甚憎齊，齊與楚從親。楚誠能絕齊，秦願獻商、於之地六百里。」楚懷王貪而信張儀，遂絕齊，使使如秦受地。張儀詐之曰：「儀與王約六里，不聞六百里。」楚使怒去，歸告懷王。懷王怒，大興師伐秦。秦發兵擊之，大破楚師於丹、淅，斬首八萬，虜楚將屈丐，遂取楚之漢中地。懷王乃悉發國中兵以深入擊秦，戰於藍田。魏聞之，襲楚至鄧。楚兵懼，自秦歸。而齊竟怒不救楚，楚大困。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"屈平","kind":"person","person_id":"4dm_2h1_9je","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"uq6_74z_vtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"楚懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"uq6_74z_vtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"uq6_74z_vtv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"楚使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論或未定指代保留。"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_